            "sid": "MAT 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus called his twelve disciples together and gave them authority to drive out evil spirits and to heal every disease and every sickness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the names of the twelve apostles: first, Simon (called Peter) and his brother Andrew; James and his brother John, the sons of Zebedee; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Philip and Bartholomew; Thomas and Matthew, the tax collector; James son of Alphaeus, and Thaddaeus; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon the Patriot, and Judas Iscariot, who betrayed Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
